<span class="ez-toc-title-toggle"><a href="#" class="ez-toc-pull-right ez-toc-btn ez-toc-btn-xs ez-toc-btn-default ez-toc-toggle" aria-label="Toggle Table of Content"><span class="ez-toc-js-icon-con"><span class=""><span class="eztoc-hide" style="display:none;">切换</span><span class="ez-toc-icon-toggle-span"><svg style="fill: #999;color:#999" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="list-377408" width="20px" height="20px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M6 6H4v2h2V6zm14 0H8v2h12V6zM4 11h2v2H4v-2zm16 0H8v2h12v-2zM4 16h2v2H4v-2zm16 0H8v2h12v-2z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg><svg style="fill: #999;color:#999" class="arrow-unsorted-368013" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="10px" height="10px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" version="1.2" baseProfile="tiny"><path d="M18.2 9.3l-6.2-6.3-6.2 6.3c-.2.2-.3.4-.3.7s.1.5.3.7c.2.2.4.3.7.3h11c.3 0 .5-.1.7-.3.2-.2.3-.5.3-.7s-.1-.5-.3-.7zM5.8 14.7l6.2 6.3 6.2-6.3c.2-.2.3-.5.3-.7s-.1-.5-.3-.7c-.2-.2-.4-.3-.7-.3h-11c-.3 0-.5.1-.7.3-.2.2-.3.5-.3.7s.1.5.3.7z"/></svg></span></span></span></a></span></div><nav><ul class='ez-toc-list ez-toc-list-level-1 ' ><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-1" href="#1_The_Truth_About_Flaxseeds_and_Gluten" >1. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_4" data-source="" data-orig="The Truth About Flaxseeds and Gluten">The Truth About Flaxseeds and Gluten</span></a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-2" href="#2_Gluten_Hiding_Spots" >2. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_5" data-source="" data-orig="Gluten Hiding Spots">Gluten Hiding Spots</span></a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-3" href="#3_The_Science_Behind_Gluten_Warnings" >3. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_6" data-source="" data-orig="The Science Behind Gluten Warnings">The Science Behind Gluten Warnings</span></a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-4" href="#4_Flaxseed_Consumption_Guide" >4. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_7" data-source="" data-orig="Flaxseed Consumption Guide">Flaxseed Consumption Guide</span></a></li></ul></nav></div><h2 data-start="346" data-end="777"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="1_The_Truth_About_Flaxseeds_and_Gluten"></span><strong data-start="346" data-end="389">1. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_8" data-source="" data-orig="The Truth About Flaxseeds and Gluten">The Truth About Flaxseeds and Gluten</span></strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p data-start="346" data-end="777"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_9" data-source="" data-orig="According to the FDA’s gluten-free food standards">According to the FDA’s gluten-free food standards</span> (&lt;20百万分之一), <span class ="tr_" id="tr_10" data-source="" data-orig="flaxseeds are naturally gluten-free seeds">flaxseeds are naturally gluten-free seeds</span> [1]. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_11" data-source="" data-orig="This is due to their botanical properties—flax belongs to the flax family">This is due to their botanical properties—flax belongs to the flax family</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_12" data-source="" data-orig="while gluten proteins are only found in the endosperm of grasses such as wheat">while gluten proteins are only found in the endosperm of grasses such as wheat</span>, 大麦, 和黑麦. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_13" data-source="" data-orig="Just like a coconut tree doesn’t bear apples">Just like a coconut tree doesn’t bear apples</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_14" data-source="" data-orig="flaxseeds and gluten are from entirely different “families.”">flaxseeds and gluten are from entirely different “families.”</span></p><h2 data-start="779" data-end="1170"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="2_Gluten_Hiding_Spots"></span><strong data-start="779" data-end="805">2. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_15" data-source="" data-orig="Gluten Hiding Spots">Gluten Hiding Spots</span></strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p data-start="779" data-end="1170"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_16" data-source="" data-orig="Pay special attention to these">Pay special attention to these</span> &#8220;<span class ="tr_" id="tr_17" data-source="" data-orig="major gluten sources">major gluten sources</span>&#8221; <span class ="tr_" id="tr_18" data-source="" data-orig="in your diet">in your diet</span>:<br data-start="875" data-end="878" /><span class ="tr_" id="tr_19" data-source="" data-orig="•">•</span> <strong data-start="880" data-end="899"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_20" data-source="" data-orig="Obvious sources">Obvious sources</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_21" data-source="" data-orig="Traditional pasta">Traditional pasta</span> (<span class ="tr_" id="tr_22" data-source="" data-orig="one bowl of noodles contains about 10g of gluten">one bowl of noodles contains about 10g of gluten</span>), 啤酒 (<span class ="tr_" id="tr_23" data-source="" data-orig="each bottle contains 3-5g of barley gluten">each bottle contains 3-5g of barley gluten</span>), <span class ="tr_" id="tr_24" data-source="" data-orig="instant oatmeal">instant oatmeal</span><br data-start="1037" data-end="1040" /><span class ="tr_" id="tr_25" data-source="" data-orig="•">•</span> <strong data-start="1042" data-end="1060"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_26" data-source="" data-orig="Hidden sources">Hidden sources</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_27" data-source="" data-orig="Soy sauce">Soy sauce</span> (15<span class ="tr_" id="tr_28" data-source="" data-orig="ml contains 0.5g of wheat protein">ml contains 0.5g of wheat protein</span>), <span class ="tr_" id="tr_29" data-source="" data-orig="seasonings">seasonings</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_30" data-source="" data-orig="and binders in processed foods like meatballs">and binders in processed foods like meatballs</span></p><h2 data-start="1172" data-end="1625"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="3_The_Science_Behind_Gluten_Warnings"></span><strong data-start="1172" data-end="1213">3. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_31" data-source="" data-orig="The Science Behind Gluten Warnings">The Science Behind Gluten Warnings</span></strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p data-start="1172" data-end="1625">全球范围, 1% <span class ="tr_" id="tr_32" data-source="" data-orig="of the population suffers from celiac disease">of the population suffers from celiac disease</span> [2], <span class ="tr_" id="tr_33" data-source="" data-orig="and consuming 50mg of gluten">and consuming 50mg of gluten</span> (<span class ="tr_" id="tr_34" data-source="" data-orig="about 1/100th of a slice of bread">about 1/100th of a slice of bread</span>) <span class ="tr_" id="tr_35" data-source="" data-orig="can cause intestinal damage">can cause intestinal damage</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_36" data-source="" data-orig="I’ve seen cases where fitness enthusiasts experienced persistent diarrhea for six months">I’ve seen cases where fitness enthusiasts experienced persistent diarrhea for six months</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_37" data-source="" data-orig="only to be diagnosed with gluten sensitivity">only to be diagnosed with gluten sensitivity</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_38" data-source="" data-orig="Even in healthy individuals">Even in healthy individuals</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_39" data-source="" data-orig="excessive gluten intake can lead to bloating">excessive gluten intake can lead to bloating</span>, 疲劳, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_40" data-source="" data-orig="and other">and other</span> &#8220;<span class ="tr_" id="tr_41" data-source="" data-orig="brain fog">brain fog</span>&#8221; <span class ="tr_" id="tr_42" data-source="" data-orig="symptoms">symptoms</span>.</p><h2 data-start="1627" data-end="1729"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="4_Flaxseed_Consumption_Guide"></span><strong data-start="1627" data-end="1660">4. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_43" data-source="" data-orig="Flaxseed Consumption Guide">Flaxseed Consumption Guide</span></strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p data-start="1627" data-end="1729"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_44" data-source="" data-orig="While flaxseeds are safe">While flaxseeds are safe</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_45" data-source="" data-orig="there are some points to keep in mind">there are some points to keep in mind</span>:</p><ul data-start="1731" data-end="2605"><li data-start="1731" data-end="1994"><p data-start="1733" data-end="1994"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_46" data-source="" data-orig="Choose GFCO-certified products">Choose GFCO-certified products</span> (<span class ="tr_" id="tr_47" data-source="" data-orig="the world’s strictest gluten-free certification">the world’s strictest gluten-free certification</span>) <span class ="tr_" id="tr_48" data-source="" data-orig="to avoid cross-contamination during processing">to avoid cross-contamination during processing</span>. 例如, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_49" data-source="" data-orig="a certain oatmeal brand once had flaxseed products testing positive for gluten due to mixing on the production line">a certain oatmeal brand once had flaxseed products testing positive for gluten due to mixing on the production line</span>.</p></li><li data-start="1996" data-end="2204"><p data-start="1998" data-end="2204"><strong data-start="1998" data-end="2030"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_50" data-source="" data-orig="Grind fresh for best results">Grind fresh for best results</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_51" data-source="" data-orig="Whole flaxseeds are only">Whole flaxseeds are only</span> 35% <span class ="tr_" id="tr_52" data-source="" data-orig="digestible">digestible</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_53" data-source="" data-orig="but when ground">but when ground</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_54" data-source="" data-orig="they can reach">they can reach</span> 95% 消化率 [3]. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_55" data-source="" data-orig="I like to grind them fresh and sprinkle them on Greek yogurt at breakfast">I like to grind them fresh and sprinkle them on Greek yogurt at breakfast</span>.</p></li><li data-start="2206" data-end="2411"><p data-start="2208" data-end="2411"><strong data-start="2208" data-end="2230"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_56" data-source="" data-orig="Control the dosage">Control the dosage</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_57" data-source="" data-orig="Health Canada recommends no more than 45g per day">Health Canada recommends no more than 45g per day</span> [4], <span class ="tr_" id="tr_58" data-source="" data-orig="as excessive consumption can cause bloating">as excessive consumption can cause bloating</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_59" data-source="" data-orig="If you’re new to flaxseeds">If you’re new to flaxseeds</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_60" data-source="" data-orig="start with 5g and monitor how your body responds">start with 5g and monitor how your body responds</span>.</p></li><li data-start="2413" data-end="2605"><p data-start="2415" data-end="2605"><strong data-start="2415" data-end="2449"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_61" data-source="" data-orig="Seal and store away from light">Seal and store away from light</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_62" data-source="" data-orig="Flaxseeds are rich in Omega-3">Flaxseeds are rich in Omega-3</span> (22.8每100克克), <span class ="tr_" id="tr_63" data-source="" data-orig="so once opened">so once opened</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_64" data-source="" data-orig="store them in the fridge and use them within a month to prevent oxidation and rancidity">store them in the fridge and use them within a month to prevent oxidation and rancidity</span>.</p></li></ul><p data-start="2607" data-end="2912"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_65" data-source="" data-orig="Since I started using ground flaxseeds instead of breadcrumbs for my chicken breast coating">Since I started using ground flaxseeds instead of breadcrumbs for my chicken breast coating</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_66" data-source="" data-orig="not only have I solved the gluten issue">not only have I solved the gluten issue</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_67" data-source="" data-orig="but my Omega-3 intake has also tripled">but my Omega-3 intake has also tripled</span>. 然而, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_68" data-source="" data-orig="remember that even the best foods need to be paired scientifically">remember that even the best foods need to be paired scientifically</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_69" data-source="" data-orig="A healthy diet is always about variety and moderation">A healthy diet is always about variety and moderation</span>.</p><p data-start="2914" data-end="3102" data-is-only-node="" data-is-last-node=""><strong data-start="2914" data-end="2929">参考:</strong><br data-start="2929" data-end="2932" />[1] <span class ="tr_" id="tr_70" data-source="" data-orig="FDA Gluten-Free Labeling Final Rule">FDA Gluten-Free Labeling Final Rule</span><br data-start="2971" data-end="2974" />[2] <span class ="tr_" id="tr_71" data-source="" data-orig="Celiac Disease Foundation">Celiac Disease Foundation</span> 2020<br data-start="3008" data-end="3011" />[3] <span class ="tr_" id="tr_72" data-source="" data-orig="Canadian Nutrition Society">Canadian Nutrition Society</span> 2018 <span class ="tr_" id="tr_73" data-source="" data-orig="Research Report">Research Report</span><br data-start="3062" data-end="3065" />[4] <span class ="tr_" id="tr_74" data-source="" data-orig="Health Canada Flaxseed Guidelines">Health Canada Flaxseed Guidelines</span></p>`} />
